*.json
*.bak-*

# Built artifacts. The binary is NOT committed on purpose: publish-public.ps1
# hash-pins every binary in the publish tree so a human has to re-review it, and a
# binary that changes on every `go build` would abort every publish run. The public
# mirror ships buildable source; install.ps1 compiles it.
native/statusline.exe
native/*.exe

# The sample config IS committed - it is the public template, with no real values.
!native/statusline-config.sample.json
